[en.FOCUS_C09_COST_OF_DEVELOPMENT_3]
Price of Development III

[en.FOCUS_C09_COST_OF_DEVELOPMENT_3_desc]
Development comes with prices, but that is the price necessary for the future, no matter how much we regret doing so.

[zh.FOCUS_C09_COST_OF_DEVELOPMENT_3]
发展的代价 III

[zh.FOCUS_C09_COST_OF_DEVELOPMENT_3_desc]
发展是有代价的，但那是为了未来所必须付出的代价，无论我们多么遗憾。

